DELETE /repos/{owner}/{repo}/labels/{name}
Deletes a label using the given label name.
Required: owner (path) — The account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.; repo (path) — The name of the repository without the `.git` extension. The name is not case sensitive.; name (path)

GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/labels/{name}
